%
O5000 (COOLANT CIRCULATION)
(================================)
(SETTINGS - CHANGE VALUES BELOW)
(================================)
#1=1.0 (COOLANT ON TIME - MIN)
#2=10.0 (COOLANT OFF TIME - MIN)
#3=0 (REPEAT COUNT - 0 IS ENDLESS)
(================================)
(DO NOT EDIT BELOW THIS LINE)
(STOP WITH RESET KEY)
(================================)
IF [#1 GT 0] GOTO 10
#3000=1 (ON TIME MUST BE OVER 0)
N10 IF [#2 GT 0] GOTO 20
#3000=2 (OFF TIME MUST BE OVER 0)
N20 IF [#3 GT 0] GOTO 30
#3=99999999 (ENDLESS)
N30 #5=#1*60 (ON TIME - SEC)
#6=#2*60 (OFF TIME - SEC)
#4=0 (CYCLE COUNTER)
M05 (SPINDLE STOP)
M09 (COOLANT OFF)
WHILE [#4 LT #3] DO1
M08 (COOLANT ON)
G04 X#5
M09 (COOLANT OFF)
G04 X#6
#4=#4+1
END1
M09
M30
%
